{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27280217","formula":"C₁₈H₂₈O₂","hill":"C18H28O2","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":18.0,"H":28.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"5α-dihydronandrolone"},"descriptions":{"en":"5α-Dihydronandrolone (also known as 5α-DHN, dihydronandrolone, DHN, 5α-dihydro-19-nortestosterone, or 5α-estran-17β-ol-3-one) is a naturally occurring anabolic–androgenic steroid (AAS) and a 5α-reduced derivative of nandrolone (19-nortestosterone). It is a major metabolite of nandrolone and is formed from it by the actions of the enzyme 5α-reductase analogously to the formation of dihydrotestosterone (DHT) from testosterone. When testosterone is 5α-reduced into DHT, which is a much more potent AAS in comparison, its effects are potentiated on a local level."},"fame":2,"pubchemCid":94202,"mass":276.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@]12CC[C@H]3[C@H]([C@@H]1CC[C@@H]2O)CC[C@@H]4[C@@H]3CCC(=O)C4","inchikey":"RHVBIEJVJWNXBU-PNOKGRBDSA-N","iupac":"(5S,8R,9R,10S,13S,14S,17S)-17-hydroxy-13-methyl-2,4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12,14,15,16,17-tetradecahydro-1H-cyclopenta[a]phenanthren-3-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"94202","atoms":48,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-5.115,"y":1.116,"z":0.002,"el":"O"},{"x":5.776,"y":0.09,"z":0.425,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.967,"y":-0.697,"z":0.358,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.538,"y":-0.778,"z":-0.184,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.698,"y":0.582,"z":-0.098,"el":"C"},{"x":0.267,"y":0.449,"z":0.338,"el":"C"},{"x":1.716,"y":0.413,"z":-0.223,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.942,"y":1.789,"z":0.471,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.462,"y":1.785,"z":0.048,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.076,"y":0.322,"z":0.541,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.955,"y":-1.811,"z":0.024,"el":"C"},{"x":0.153,"y":-2.086,"z":0.217,"el":"C"},{"x":2.403,"y":-0.925,"z":0.153,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.334,"y":-1.174,"z":0.277,"el":"C"},{"x":1.582,"y":-2.134,"z":-0